E1 [Mayor of the City of Skopje] cares for the activities that with law are entrusted to the City of Skopje ;
E2 [Mayor of the City of Skopje] The Mayor of Skopje is the city mayor who is representing Macedonia 's capital city Greater Skopje and all of its municipalities .
E3 [Mayor of the City of Skopje] Also , the mayor 's decisions are confirmed or rejected by the City Council of Skopje .
E4 [Mayor of the City of Skopje] declaring the acts of the Council and publishes them in the `` Official Gazette of the City of Skopje '' ;
E5 [Mayor of the City of Skopje] Mayor cooperates with the municipal mayors of the city of Skopje , for building common views , common setting priorities and taking joint action on certain issues and problems of interest to the city as a whole .
